<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1863</h1><p class="ref-lede">1863 in world history: 29 events, 19 births, 12 deaths, 1 work, 5 states founded and 5 that came to an end. 1,044 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
